graph TD
    subgraph 数据准备
        A[原始数据源] --> B(特征提取);
        B --> C{缺失值处理};
        C -- 填充/删除 --> D(异常值检测);
        D --> E{数据标准化};
        E -- Z-score/MinMax --> F(数据转换);
    end

    subgraph 特征选择
        F --> G[特征评估];
        G --> H{特征重要性排序};
        H --> I{选择 Top-N 特征};
    end

    subgraph 特征衍生
        I --> J(特征组合);
        J --> K(多项式特征);
        K --> L(特征交叉);
    end

    subgraph 特征验证
        L --> M[模型训练];
        M --> N{性能评估};
        N -- 合格 --> O(特征集发布);
        N -- 不合格 --> P{回溯分析};
        P --> G;
    end

    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style O fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px

    classDef process fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef decision fill:#e2e2e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    class A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H,I,J,K,L process
    class N,P decision